## Global Rule Instructions

1. .md file operation requires reading docs/md/md-operations.md first. No exceptions.

2. Git operations → read docs/git/git-workflow-standard.md first. No exceptions.

3. GitHub link reading → read docs/git/git-gh-operations.md first. No exceptions.

4. Architecture work → read `docs/architecture/layer-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

5. Business / product UI conventions (user-facing strings, labels, status text, empty states, placeholders) → read `docs/biz/ui-conventions.md` first. No exceptions.
